cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "dil-core: a reference implementation of the DIL (Data Integration Loop) protocol"
abstract: >-
  dil-core is a reference implementation of the DIL protocol: a self-enriching
  data-integration loop operating in a purely informational environment, with an
  append-only, hash-chained, audit-ready event trail. DIL is not a model, a
  controller, or a library the host calls; it specifies the conditions under
  which a self forms, fixing the invariants and the flow of data without ever
  acting, emitting, or commanding.
type: software
